---
title: Quantization Data/Control Flow
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CLI
    participant QEntry as llama_model_quantize<br>llama-quant.cpp:1309
    participant QImpl as llama_model_quantize_impl<br>llama-quant.cpp:857
    participant Loader as llama_model_loader<br>llama-model-loader.cpp:31
    participant QState as quantize_state_impl<br>llama-quant.cpp:163
    participant TypeSel as llama_tensor_get_type<br>llama-quant.cpp:661
    participant TypeImpl as llama_tensor_get_type_impl<br>llama-quant.cpp:411
    participant Dequant as llama_tensor_dequantize_impl<br>llama-quant.cpp:212
    participant QuantKern as llama_tensor_quantize_impl<br>llama-quant.cpp:709
    participant GGMLQ as ggml_quantize_chunk<br>ggml.c:7706
    participant GGMLInit as ggml_quantize_init<br>ggml.c:7666
    participant QKernel as quantize_q*_K / iq*<br>ggml-quants.c
    participant GGUFO as gguf_context (output)<br>gguf.cpp
    participant FileOut as Output GGUF File

    User->>QEntry: llama_model_quantize(fname_inp, fname_out, params)
    QEntry->>QImpl: delegate

    QImpl->>Loader: llama_model_loader(file, mmap, ...)
    QImpl->>QState: quantize_state_impl(model, params)

    alt imatrix provided
        QImpl->>QState: load and validate imatrix data (lines 903-921)
    end

    QImpl->>Loader: build tensor list (lines 964-991)

    loop preliminary loop (lines 1021-1056)
        QImpl->>TypeSel: llama_tensor_get_type(tensor, default_type, metadata)
        TypeSel->>TypeImpl: llama_tensor_get_type_impl(category, ftype, ...)
        TypeImpl-->>TypeSel: adjusted new_type

        alt shape incompatible
            TypeSel->>TypeSel: tensor_type_fallback() (line 699)
        end

        alt requires imatrix & not provided
            TypeSel-->>QImpl: throw error
        end

        TypeSel-->>QImpl: target ggml_type
        QImpl->>QImpl: metadata[i].target_type = result
    end

    loop main loop (lines 1115-1263)
        QImpl->>Loader: load_data_for(tensor) (line 1134)

        alt same type (no quantization)
            QImpl->>QImpl: copy data directly (line 1174)
        else quantize
            QImpl->>Dequant: llama_tensor_dequantize_impl() (line 1218)
            Dequant->>Dequant: ggml_type_traits.to_float() / f16->f32 (lines 232-273)
            Dequant-->>QImpl: f32_data buffer

            QImpl->>QuantKern: llama_tensor_quantize_impl() (line 1247)
            QuantKern->>GGMLQ: ggml_quantize_chunk(type, f32_data, dst, ...)
            GGMLQ->>GGMLInit: ggml_quantize_init(type) (noop if done, line 7723)
            GGMLInit->>GGMLInit: iq2xs_init_impl/iq3xs_init_impl (lines 7670-7676)
            GGMLQ->>QKernel: quantize_q4_K / quantize_iq2_xxs / etc. (lines 7730-7754)
            QKernel-->>GGMLQ: compressed block data

            QuantKern->>QuantKern: ggml_validate_row_data() (line 744)
            QuantKern-->>QImpl: new_size
        end

        QImpl->>GGUFO: gguf_set_tensor_type(name, new_type) (line 1255)
        QImpl->>GGUFO: gguf_set_tensor_data(name, new_data) (line 1257)
        QImpl->>FileOut: fout.write(new_data, new_size) (line 1260)
    end

    QImpl->>FileOut: close_ofstream() (line 1266)
    QImpl-->>QEntry: return
    QEntry-->>User: 0 (success) or 1 (exception)
